l Products (Certificate No. AGI02568).</p><h2 data-start="1326" data-end="1352"><strong data-start="1326" data-end="1352">Product Specifications</strong></h2><p>&gt;</p><table border="1" data-start="1354" data-end="1948"><thead data-start="1354" data-end="1413"><tr data-start="1354" data-end="1413"><th data-start="1354" data-end="1373">Parameter</th><th data-start="1373" data-end="1413">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1474" data-end="1948"><tr data-start="1474" data-end="1538"><td>Grade</td><td>Grade A (Full grains, breakage rate ≤ 1%)</td></tr><tr data-start="1539" data-end="1601"><td>Size</td><td>18-22mm (Large seeds, uniformity ≥ 95%)</td></tr><tr data-start="1602" data-end="1672"><td>Moisture Content</td><td>≤ 13% (Compliant with GB/T 10459-2008 standard)</td></tr><tr data-start="1673" data-end="1756"><td>Packaging</td><td>10kg/bag (coated woven bag), 500g/bag (vacuum small package)</td></tr><tr data-start="1757" data-end="1868"><td>Shelf Life</td><td>12 months (Store in a cool, dry place; refrigeration recommended for extended freshness)</td></tr><tr data-start="1869" data-end="1948"><td>Impurity Rate</td><td>≤ 0.5% (Color sorting machine + manual double screening)</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong data-start="1950" data-end="1987">Nutritional Components (per 100g)</strong><strong data-start="2720" data-end="2745">Application Scenarios</strong><strong data-start="2747" data-end="2767">Food Processing:</strong></p><ul><li data-start="2768" data-end="2865"><strong data-start="2770" data-end="2786">Snack Foods:</strong> Crispy fava beans, five-spice fava beans, mustard-flavored ready-to-eat beans.</li><li data-start="2866" data-end="2987"><strong data-start="2868" data-end="2900">Deep Processing Ingredients:</strong> Fava bean flour (used in baking), plant protein extraction, fava bean canned products.</li></ul><p><strong data-start="2989" data-end="3010">Culinary Cooking:</strong></p><ul><li data-start="3011" data-end="3109"><strong data-start="3013" data-end="3036">Home-cooked Dishes:</strong> Stir-fried fava beans with cured meat, fava bean stew, fava bean hummus.</li><li data-start="3110" data-end="3169"><strong data-start="3112" data-end="3122">Soups:</strong> Fava bean and ham soup, vegetarian broth base.</li></ul><p><strong data-start="3171" data-end="3188">Healthy Diet:</strong></p><ul><li data-start="3189" data-end="3274">Plant-based protein supplement, low-fat light meals, baby food (requires grinding).</li></ul><p><strong data-start="3276" data-end="3297">Agricultural Use:</strong></p><ul><li data-start="3298" data-end="3388">Crop rotation green manure (strong nitrogen fixation), straw can be used as animal feed.</li></ul><p><strong data-start="3390" data-end="3427">Quality Control and Certification</strong></p><ul><li data-start="3428" data-end="3483">Certified by ISO 22000 Food Safety Management System.</li><li data-start="3484" data-end="3576">Pesticide Residue Testing: 315 items with zero detection (based on GB 2763-2021 standard).</li><li data-start="3577" data-end="3674">Heavy Metal Limits: Lead ≤ 0.2mg/kg, Cadmium ≤ 0.1mg/kg (30% stricter than national standards).</li></ul><p><strong data-start="3676" data-end="3701">Ordering Information:</strong></p><ul><li data-start="3702" data-end="3791">Minimum Order Quantity: 1 ton (mixed packaging available), OEM customization supported.</li><li data-start="3792" data-end="3901">Shipping Time: Packaged within 72 hours, delivery within 48 hours to the Tianjin Port.</li></ul><table border="1"><thead data-start="1989" data-end="2053"><tr data-start="1989" data-end="2053"><th data-start="1989" data-end="2008">Component</th><th data-start="2008" data-end="2018">Content</th><th data-start="2018" data-end="2053">Function Value</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2120" data-end="2718"><tr data-start="2120" data-end="2220"><td>Protein</td><td>25.3g</td><td>High-quality plant protein source, contains 8 essential amino acids</td></tr><tr data-start="2221" data-end